text:
North Shore has {变量1} beds, local waterworks and workshops, and an old fleet ready to sail once repaired. Local schedules prioritize farms, medical care, and schools.
{分支2}
“Industrial Supplies” diverts more smelting capacity, scrap, and wood. Local wood and tool requirements for facility maintenance each period are doubled, and the dock's cargo manifest shifts to iron; the medicine supply limit falls back to 80. If supplies run out, the dock will suspend sailings first. Each commission change costs 4 knowledge from this city.
